{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》話題持續發酵，現年36歲、曾任投資銀行高層的參賽者關經翰（Oswald），憑藉健碩身形與優厚背景在節目中大受歡迎。</p><p>他先後獲得俞可程與梁超怡青睞，更獲女神陳星妤欽點共進晚餐及「同帳幕過夜」。</p><p>然而，螢幕上看似專一深情的</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.544128+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:11:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_hash":"cf55aab3adb8f36c1b5b7b6044d3f428d5d48522708a9d3cbb487b9a81d51987","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}